flowchart LR
    A[Traffic] --> B[Score it] --> C{Alarm?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Not<br/>learned]
    C -- No --> E[Propose an<br/>update from the<br/>most normal<br/>samples]
    E --> F[Share and<br/>combine with<br/>neighbours]
    F --> H{Neighbours<br/>agree?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Learn it]
    H -- No --> J[Allow slowly,<br/>within a<br/>budget]
    I --> K[Update<br/>normal]
    J --> K
    K -- next cycle --> A
